/* ============================================================================
 * DEPRECATED - kept only so an existing deployment does not break.
 *
 * The custom widget rules are now GENERATED per theme by
 * ``ui.styles.custom_widget_qss()``. A static file cannot work here: it is
 * appended after the theme stylesheet, so its literal colours would win the
 * cascade and repaint every accent button violet on the high contrast theme.
 *
 * Put project specific overrides in ``config/themes/<theme>_theme.qss``
 * instead; that file is applied last and is never regenerated.
 * ==========================================================================*/
